<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103976" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῑμ-ήεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμήϝεντα </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμετε</span>[ lapis)
		prob. in <i><span class="en">
			<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
			4.44
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Sicily</span>); 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμῆς</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			9.605
		</span></i>; acc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμῆντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.475
				</span></i>
			; 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμάεις</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				21.599
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμάεντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					4(3).7(25)
				</span></i>
			; Pamphyl. fem. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμάϝεσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Schwyzer</u>
					686.6
				</span></i>
			:—<i>honoured, esteemed</i>, of men or gods, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.605
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.161
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμηέστερος πέλεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.393
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>prized, costly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.475
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.393
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.312
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶρον] τιμηέστατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.614
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				15.114
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπόλημα -έστατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					1226
				</span></i>
			: 
				Dor.
			
			
				contr.
			
			
				Sup.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμαστάτων</span> (gen. pl.) may perh. be
			restored in <i><span class="en">
				Archyt.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.48.6
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμαιέτατων, τιμαετάτων,
				τιμαοτάτων</span> codd., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμαεστάτων</span> cj. Gaisf.).</div>
